1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site-main page-why","id":"main","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"page-heading","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"mycmux ガイド"}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"考え方"}],"$undefined","$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"intro","children":[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>エージェントとの会話が増えると、全部を開いて読む時間が足りなくなります。任せた仕事が見えない場所で止まっていれば、返事が必要なことにも気づけません。mycmux は、作業を並べる場所と、状態を確かめる手段をひとつの画面に置きます。</p>"}}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"reading-layout","children":[["$","$Le",null,{"sections":[{"id":"visible","title":"1. 見える場所での委譲"},{"id":"observe","title":"2. 観測から処置までの一本の線"},{"id":"facts","title":"3. 機械が書く事実と、本人しか書けない言葉"},{"id":"keys","title":"4. 起動ごとに配る鍵"},{"id":"ownership","title":"5. 責務の置き場所"},{"id":"change","title":"この考え方が変わるとき"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"reading-article","children":[["$","details",null,{"className":"mobile-contents","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"このページの目次"}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"このページの目次","children":["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","visible",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#visible","children":"1. 見える場所での委譲"}]}],["$","li","observe",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#observe","children":"2. 観測から処置までの一本の線"}]}],["$","li","facts",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#facts","children":"3. 機械が書く事実と、本人しか書けない言葉"}]}],["$","li","keys",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#keys","children":"4. 起動ごとに配る鍵"}]}],["$","li","ownership",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#ownership","children":"5. 責務の置き場所"}]}],["$","li","change",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#change","children":"この考え方が変わるとき"}]}]]}]}]]}],["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","section","visible",{"id":"visible","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"1. 見える場所での委譲"}],[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>別のエージェントへ任せた仕事も、途中で開いて確かめられる形にします。端末の区画をタブ、その中で切り替える単位をペインと呼びます。委譲先を画面上のペインとして起動したものが<strong>可視ペイン</strong>です。</p><p>エージェントは Web ペインを裏で開き、読んだり操作したりできます。できる操作は<a href=\"/guide/agents#delegate-setup\">別のエージェントへ任せたい</a>に挙げています。</p><p>先に全体の構成を置きます。この節と 4 節で扱うのは、図の中で委譲 CLI と hook がローカルソケットを通る経路です。</p>"}}],["$","figure","1",{"className":"fig","data-fig":"F2","children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"fig-wide","viewBox":"0 0 1120 560","width":"100%","role":"img","aria-label":"mycmux ウィンドウと、PTY 上の CLI、Web サービス、委譲 CLI と hook が通るローカルソケットの関係図","data-vw":1120,"data-fs":23,"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","children":[["$","title",null,{"children":"mycmux ウィンドウと、PTY 上の CLI、Web サービス、委譲 CLI と hook が通るローカルソケットの関係図"}],["$","defs",null,{"children":[["$","marker",null,{"id":"F2-wide-arrow","viewBox":"0 0 10 10","refX":"9","refY":"5","markerWidth":"8","markerHeight":"8","orient":"auto-start-reverse","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M0 0L10 5L0 10z","className":"arrowhead"}]}],["$","marker",null,{"id":"F2-wide-arrow-accent","viewBox":"0 0 10 10","refX":"9","refY":"5","markerWidth":"8","markerHeight":"8","orient":"auto-start-reverse","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M0 0L10 5L0 10z","className":"arrowhead accent"}]}]]}],[["$","g","0",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M240 95.2L350 95","className":"edge","markerEnd":"url(#F2-wide-arrow)","markerStart":"$undefined"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","g","1",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M880 275L770 275","className":"edge","markerEnd":"url(#F2-wide-arrow)","markerStart":"$undefined"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","g","2",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M560 410L560 340","className":"edge dashed","markerEnd":"url(#F2-wide-arrow)","markerStart":"$undefined"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","g","3",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M240 450L330 450","className":"edge dashed","markerEnd":"url(#F2-wide-arrow)","markerStart":"$undefined"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","g","4",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M880 450L790 450","className":"edge dashed","markerEnd":"url(#F2-wide-arrow)","markerStart":"$undefined"}],"$undefined"]}]],[["$","g","cli",{"className":"node n-group","data-w":240,"data-id":"cli","children":