27:["$","figure","5",{"className":"shot shot-content","data-shot":"09_delegation-visible-tab","children":[["$","picture",null,{"children":"$43"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"fig-no","children":"図 3"}],"委譲先の Codex が右のタブに開いています。可視ペインなので、途中から直接指示を足せます。",["$","a",null,{"className":"shot-full","href":"/shots/09_delegation-visible-tab.png","children":"画像を原寸で開く"}]]}]]}]
28:["$","div","6",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>アプリでは、公開リポジトリの CLI にある <code>spawn</code> がこの役を担います。完了マーカーだけでなく、ログの増分と編集ファイルの更新時刻も見ます。マーカーは、委譲する前に出力先を指示書で決めておくファイルです。</p><p>アプリ側に、エージェントの振る舞いを強制する仕組みはありません。「委譲は見える形で行う」とエージェント側のルールにも書いて、運用で守ります。見る人のいない自律ジョブ、大量に並列化する工程、介入の余地がない短い照合は例外です。</p><p><a href=\"/guide/agents#delegate\">委譲の準備と手順</a></p>"}}]
29:["$","section","observe",{"id":"observe","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"2. 観測から処置までの一本の線"}],[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>状態を知る手段が増えても、画面ごとに違う判断を出さない設計を選びます。</p><p>あとからダッシュボードの「気づきカード」の並びを直しました。作業の停止や回答待ちを知らせるカードです。それまでは、外から届いた調整事項が、緊急でも参考情報でも同じ高さに並んでいました。</p>"}}],["$","figure","1",{"className":"fig","data-fig":"F4","children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"fig-wide","viewBox":"0 0 720 250","width":"100%","role":"img","aria-label":"画面スキャン・hook・rollout ログの 3 つの入口が 1 つの状態に合流し、気づきカードを経て処置に至る図","data-vw":720,"data-fs":15,"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","children":[["$","title",null,{"children":"画面スキャン・hook・rollout ログの 3 つの入口が 1 つの状態に合流し、気づきカードを経て処置に至る図"}],["$","defs",null,{"children":[["$","marker",null,{"id":"F4-wide-arrow","viewBox":"0 0 10 10","refX":"9","refY":"5","markerWidth":"8","markerHeight":"8","orient":"auto-start-reverse","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M0 0L10 5L0 10z","className":"arrowhead"}]}],["$","marker",null,{"id":"F4-wide-arrow-accent","viewBox":"0 0 10 10","refX":"9","refY":"5","markerWidth":"8","markerHeight":"8","orient":"auto-start-reverse","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M0 0L10 5L0 10z","className":"arrowhead accent"}]}]]}],[["$","g","0",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M160 26L187.5 26L187.5 85.6L215 85.6","className":"edge","markerEnd":"url(#F4-wide-arrow)","markerStart":"$undefined"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","g","1",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M160 96L215 96","className":"edge","markerEnd":"url(#F4-wide-arrow)","markerStart":"$undefined"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","g","2",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M160 166L187.5 166L187.5 106.4L215 106.4","className":"edge","markerEnd":"url(#F4-wide-arrow)","markerStart":"$undefined"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","g","3",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M375 96L400 96","className":"edge  accent","markerEnd":"url(#F4-wide-arrow-accent)","markerStart":"$undefined"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","g","4",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M560 96L590 96","class