2a:["$","section","facts",{"id":"facts","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"3. 機械が書く事実と、本人しか書けない言葉"}],[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>テストの終了結果と、その結果をどう読んだかを分けて残します。</p><p>以前の「報告インボックス」では、実ログから事実を拾う処理が動いていない不具合を、あとから直しました。画面があっても、元の記録を読めていなければ役に立たないと分かった出来事です。この画面はのちに撤去し、いまはダッシュボードの「気づき」列が役を引き継いでいます。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr><th>残す内容</th><th>誰が確かめられるか</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>ファイルの変更、テストの結果、終了した事実</td><td>記録を読める機械が確かめます。</td></tr>\n<tr><td>何を発見したか、なぜその判断をしたか</td><td>作業したエージェント本人の説明が要ります。</td></tr></tbody></table><p>全セッション履歴の検索では、読み書きやテスト結果を機械だけで記録します。索引を作るときに言語モデルは呼びません。ダッシュボードの「気づき」列には、対応が必要なものに絞って、事実だけのカードを表示します。</p><p>「保存しました」という言葉だけで、成果物があるとは扱いません。説明を読んだ後も、ファイルとテスト結果で確かめる余地を残します。</p>"}}]]]}]
2b:["$","section","keys",{"id":"keys","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"4. 起動ごとに配る鍵"}],[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>状態を知らせる権限は、どのエージェントの、どの起動なのかと結び付けます。</p><p>設計のとき、GitHub の公開プロジェクト stablyai/orca の認証方式を調べました。共通の鍵を端末へ渡す方式では、そこから起動した子プロセスまで書き込めてしまいます。鍵をタブごとに分けるだけでも、再起動前の通知が新しい作業へ届く余地が残ります。</p><p>委譲 CLI は、アプリの起動ごとに変わる認証トークンを自動で添えます。<strong>hook</strong> は、エージェントが終了や質問などを知らせる仕組みです。hook には、委譲 CLI のトークンとは別の権限情報を使います。</p><p>その権限情報（capability）は、次の 4 つに結び付いています。</p>\n<ul><li>タブ：どの端末の区画か。</li><li>provider：Claude、Codex、Grok のどれか（CLI の系統）。</li><li>launch_generation：同じタブで何回目の起動か。</li><li>app_instance：どの mycmux の起動か。</li></ul>"}}],["$","figure","1",{"className":"fig","data-fig":"F7","children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"fig-wide","viewBox":"0 0 720 400","width":"100%","role":"img","aria-label":"ソケットのトークンと hook の capability という 2 つの鍵と、capability を束ねる 4 要素、守る範囲と守らない範囲","data-vw":720,"data-fs":15,"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","children":[["$","title",null,{"children":"ソケットのトークンと hook の capability という 2 つの鍵と、capability を束ねる 4 要素、守る範囲と守らない範囲"}],["$","defs",null,{"children":[["$","marker",null,{"id":"F7-wide-arrow","viewBox":"0 0 10 10","refX":"9","refY":"5","markerWidth":"8","markerHeight":"8","orient":"auto-start-reverse","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M0 0L10 5L0 10z","className":"arrowhead"}]}],["$","marker",null,{"id":"F7-wide-arrow-accent","viewBox":"0 0 10 10","refX":"9","refY":"5","markerWidth":"8","markerHeight":"8","orient":"auto-start-reverse","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M0 0L10 5L0 10z","className":"arrowhead accent"}]}]]}],[["$","g","0",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M550 136L550 172","className":"edge","markerEnd":"url(#F7-wide-arrow)","markerStart":"$undefined"}],["$","g",null,{"className":"edge-label-group","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":490.3,"y":142.75,"width":119.4,"height":22.5,"rx":4,"className":"edge-label-bg"}],["$","text",null,{"x":550,"y":159.25,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"className":"edge-label","children":"4 要素に束ねる"}]]}]]}]],[["$","g","k1",{"className":"node n-accent","data-w":340,"data-id":"k1","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":0,"y":0,"width":340,"height":136,"rx":8}],["$","text",null,{"x":170,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":170,"y":27.25,"className":"title","children":"ソケットのトークン"}],["$","tspan","1",{"x":170,"y":50.25,"className":"sub","children":"アプリの起動ごとに変わる"}],["$","tspan","2",{"x":170,"y":73.25,"className":"sub","children":"委譲 CLI が自動で添える"}],["$","tspan","3",{"x":170,"y":96.25,"className":"sub","children":"ペイン操作　spawn・send・read"}],["$","tspan","4",{"x":170,"y":119.25,"className":"sub","children":"ログにも画面にも残らない"}]]}]]}],["$","g","k2",{"className":"node n-accent","data-w":340,"data-id":"k2","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":380,"y":0,"width":340,"height":136,"rx":8}],["$","text",null,{"x":550,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":550,"y":38.75,"className":"title","children":"hook の capability"}],["$","tspan","1",{"x":550,"y":61.75,"className":"sub","children":"起動ごとに発行　別の権限領域"}],["$","tspan","2",{"x":550,"y":84.75,"className":"sub","children":"状態の登録だけ"}],["$","tspan","3",{"x":550,"y":107.75,"className":"sub","children":"操作へは上がれない"}]]}]]}],["$","g","e0",{"className":"node n-plain","data-w":340,"data-id":"e0","children":[false,["$","text",null,{"x":550,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[]}]]}],["$","g","e1",{"className":"node n-chip","data-w":164,"data-id":"e1","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":380,"y":172,"width":164,"height":36,"rx":18}],["$","text",null,{"x":462,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":462,"y":195.25,"className":"title","children":"タブ"}]]}]]}],["$","g","e2",{"className":"node n-chip","data-w":164,"data-id":"e2","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":556,"y":172,"width":164,"height":36,"rx":18}],["$","text",null,{"x":638,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":638,"y":195.25,"className":"title mono","children":"provider"}]]}]]}],["$","g","e3",{"className":"node n-chip","data-w":164,"data-id":"e3","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":380,"y":218,"width":164,"height":36,"rx":18}],["$","text",null,{"x":462,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":462,"y":241.25,"className":"title mono","children":"launch_generation"}]]}]]}],["$","g","e4",{"className":"node n-chip","data-w":164,"data-id":"e4","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":556,"y":218,"width":164,"height":36,"rx":18}],["$","text",null,{"x":638,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":638,"y":241.25,"className":"title mono","children":"app_instance"}]]}]]}],["$","g","n1",{"className":"node n-plain","data-w":340,"data-id":"n1","children":[false,["$","text",null,{"x":12,"textAnchor":"start","fontSize":15,"children":[["$","tspan","0",{"x":12,"y":206.75,"className":"title","children":"操作用の鍵。委譲 CLI が自動で添える"}],["$","tspan","1",{"x":12,"y":229.75,"className":"sub","children":"ので、人が手で扱う場面はない"}]]}]]}],["$","g","g0",{"className":"node n-plain","data-w":720,"data-id":"g0","children":[false,["$","text",null,{"x":12,"textAnchor":"start","fontSize":15,"children":["$L54"]}]]}],"$L55","$L56"],"$undefined"]}],"$undefined","$L57","$L58"]}],"$L59"]]}]
2c:["$","section","ownership",{"id":"ownership","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"5. 責務の置き場所"}],[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>画面を作り直すときも、動いている起動処理まで同時には置き換えませんでした。</p><p>以前のランチャーは、端末に 19 項目を描く文字メニューでした（現行のランチャーペインとは別のものです）。マウス操作が届かず、ペインが低いと上端の項目が流れて見えなくなりました。そこで、クリックで選べる現在のランチャーペインに置き換えました。</p><p>移したのは、表示と操作だけです。会話を識別する ID の発行や、作業フォルダの復元は、既存の起動処理に残しました。「続きから」の候補も、<span class=\"keys\"><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"key-join\">+</span><kbd>P</kbd></span> の Resume と同じ一覧取得処理を使います。</p><p>設計の途中で、Resume、アイコン、起動カタログを既存の部品と気づかず、新しく作ろうとしました。新しい画面の話でも、まず使える部品を探し、それから責務を決めます。起動と、すでに開いているペインへの移動を、ひとつの検索窓には混ぜません。</p>"}}]]]}]
2d:["$","section","change",{"id":"change","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"この考え方が変わるとき"}],[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>判断を変えるときは、理由を <strong>ADR（設計の決定記録）</strong>に残してから説明を更新します。たとえば、起動ごとの権限情報を意図したプロセスへ渡せないと実測できたら、配り方を考え直します。変えた結論と、変える根拠になった観測は、いつも一緒に残します。</p><p>開発は 2026-03-15 の最初のコミットから続いており、この記録も版ごとに更新しています。</p><p>設計の決定がいまの実装でどう動いているかは、<a href=\"/dev\">開発者向け</a>のページで詳しく読めます。</p><p class=\"link-row\"><a href=\"https://github.com/miyafcos/mycmux-team/tree/master/docs/adr\">公開リポジトリの設計記録</a><a href=\"/recipes\">実務で使う例</a></p>"}}]]]}]
